#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20002
#: 238cc4ceb74c4cd6bd28e5a861240064
msgid "Tutorial: Transfer Function Measurement"
msgstr "チュートリアル: 伝達関数の測定"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20004
#: 79a0ffacbc6f484ab03e464717aeb0b0
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to use `gwexpy` to estimate the transfer "
"function of a system from measured data, fit a physical model to the "
"transfer function, and identify system parameters."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、`gwexpy` を使用して測定データからシステムの伝達関数（Transfer Function）を推定し、 "
"物理モデルへのフィッティングを行ってパラメータを同定する流れを解説します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20007
#: 3d591667b1cf4e0fa5b0b6b57467e043
msgid ""
"**Scenario:** We inject white noise into a mechanical vibration system (or "
"electrical circuit) and measure its response. From this input-output data, "
"we will determine the system's resonance frequency $f_0$ and quality factor "
"$Q$."
msgstr ""
"**シナリオ:** ある機械振動系（または電気回路）に白色雑音を入力し、その応答を測定しました。 この入出力データから、システムの共振周波数 $f_0$"
" と Q値 $Q$ を求めます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20011
#: 16b147e652ab4644b10dc4be262895bb
msgid "**Workflow:**"
msgstr "**ワークフロー:**"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20012
#: 3c2c0299910c4056b3cd9fcbf46e5cb4
msgid ""
"**Data generation**: Simulate an input signal (white noise) and the system "
"output (resonant system response + measurement noise)."
msgstr "**データ生成**: 入力信号（白色雑音）と、それに対するシステムの出力（共振系応答 + 測定ノイズ）をシミュレーションします。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20013
#: e25fc58548684913ba671d65854aec2a
msgid ""
"**Transfer function estimation**: Calculate the transfer function and "
"coherence from the input-output time series data and plot the Bode plot."
msgstr "**伝達関数の推定**: 入出力の時系列データから伝達関数とコヒーレンスを計算し、ボード線図（Bode Plot）を描画します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20014
#: 9f516c58d1fe43349d25f09cbc715f70
msgid ""
"**Model fitting**: Fit a theoretical model (such as a Lorentzian function) "
"to the estimated transfer function to extract system parameters."
msgstr "**モデルフィッティング**: 推定した伝達関数に理論モデル（ローレンツ関数など）を当てはめ、パラメータを推定します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40002
#: fd7798cdde2b47919547e86ec64bfb41
msgid "1. Generating Experimental Data (Simulation)"
msgstr "1\\. 実験データの生成（シミュレーション）"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40004
#: 5975c3de7652494ca579c9d1ff158a6a
msgid "We will conduct a virtual experiment."
msgstr "仮想的な実験を行います。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40005
#: 0f2d7ae1539948019823d73ccd122a6c
msgid "**System**: Second-order resonant system (harmonic oscillator)"
msgstr "**システム**: 2次共振系（単振動）"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40006
#: ef2157f64ea040d994fcb772c112842b
msgid "Resonance frequency $f_0 = 300$ Hz"
msgstr "共振周波数 $f_0 = 300$ Hz"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40007
#: 78aae41f02304740a49406781a835086
msgid "Quality factor $Q = 50$"
msgstr "Q値 $Q = 50$"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40008
#: 50429d0bbe78444bb709b8b3ee0b912a
msgid "**Input**: White noise"
msgstr "**入力**: 白色雑音（White Noise）"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40009
#: a23d21805059441793020373a24b63d6
msgid "**Measurement**: Sampling frequency 2048 Hz, duration 60 seconds"
msgstr "**測定**: サンプリング周波数 2048 Hz, 継続時間 60秒"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40011
#: e3da4f4429274d3793c40cabfb614ee9
msgid "The output signal will also include measurement noise."
msgstr "出力信号には、測定に伴うノイズも付加します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:60002
#: 0d357ebefbb44edf9b29f6d978ec039c
msgid "2. Transfer Function Estimation"
msgstr "2\\. 伝達関数の推定"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:60004
#: 1429e7093f3c4318bc89b22e16775a17
msgid ""
"From the input-output time series data `ts_input` and `ts_output`, we "
"estimate the frequency response function (transfer function). We use the "
"`transfer_function` method of `gwexpy`."
msgstr ""
"入出力の時系列データ `ts_input` と `ts_output` から、周波数応答関数（伝達関数）を推定します。 `gwexpy` の "
"`transfer_function` メソッドを使用します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:60007
#: f90759339b4e45e1b44b99a2700fdf75
msgid ""
"We also calculate the **coherence** to assess the reliability of the "
"measurement. Frequency bands where the coherence is close to 1 indicate that"
" the input-output relationship is linear and the influence of noise is "
"small."
msgstr ""
"また、測定の信頼性を確認するために**コヒーレンス（Coherence）**も計算します。 コヒーレンスが 1 "
"に近い周波数帯域は、入出力の関係が線形であり、ノイズの影響が少ないことを示します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:80002
#: 58bdd98d5273433386365b5c93e870b2
msgid "3. Model Fitting"
msgstr "3\\. モデルフィッティング"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:80004
#: 677b573714ee4a8091271bd829f17066
msgid ""
"We fit a theoretical model to the obtained transfer function (especially "
"around the resonance). Here, we define a transfer function model for a "
"harmonic oscillator and use least-squares fitting to determine the "
"parameters ($A, f_0, Q$)."
msgstr ""
"得られた伝達関数（特に共振付近）に対して、理論モデルをフィッティングします。 ここでは、単振動の伝達関数モデルを定義し、最小二乗法でパラメータ（$A, "
"f_0, Q$）を求めます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:80007
#: 8f77e6a16d2c461e90243616a580f290
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Model equation (including gain $A$): $$ H(f) = A \\cdot \\frac{f_0^2}{f_0^2 "
"- f^2 + i (f f_0 / Q)} $$"
msgstr ""
"モデル式（ゲイン $A$ を含む）： $$ H(f) = A \\cdot \\frac{f_0^2}{f_0^2 - f^2 + i (f f_0 /"
" Q)} $$"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:100002
#: fca3150bb8f945989a46100d05444b8a
msgid "4. Verification of Results"
msgstr "4\\. 結果の確認"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:100004
#: 089f3ce9b7e04f58b4259a61c193d35f
msgid ""
"We verify the fitting results numerically and plot them overlaid on the "
"measured data. The `FitResult.plot()` method automatically generates a Bode "
"plot (magnitude and phase) for complex data."
msgstr ""
"フィッティング結果を数値で確認し、測定データに重ねてプロットします。 `FitResult.plot()` "
"メソッドは、複素数データの場合、自動的にボード線図（振幅・位相）を描画します。"
